            <ArticleTitle>[Ultrasound as a diagnostic aid in psoas abscesses (author's transl)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>239-45</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In 2 cases of psoas abscesses ultrasonic tomograms have been made in addition to the routine examinations. The experiences of these results show that the implication of this method seems to be of great help for a more exact preoperative diagnosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
